@startuml
participant "manifest+lock\n(web, dashboard)" as L
participant "CI client gate" as CI
participant "Dockerfile.prod" as D
participant "server.js\n(next start standalone)" as S
participant "proxy.ts" as P
participant "pages / route handlers" as R

L -> CI : next 16.3.4 + @next/swc-* 16.3.4 (npm ci)
CI -> CI : image-codec.check.mjs, lint, typecheck, build
L -> D : same lock (npm ci)
D -> S : .next/standalone, node server.js
S -> P : matcher-selected request (Node.js runtime)
P -> R : web matched: redirect/rewrite/intl\ndashboard protected: auth + canAccess
S -> R : web /api, _next, _vercel, dotted paths\nbypass proxy matcher
P -> R : dashboard /api/auth/* early return\nbefore protected user + canAccess checks
R --> S : HTML / JSON
note over R
  next/og ImageResponse side-hop: offen,
  not simulated (no call site)
end note
@enduml

@startuml
' Preserved EKA-18 path integrated from origin/main during T-486 refresh
title Local developer stack: Quick Start to bounded datastore listeners

actor Developer
participant "README Quick Start" as ER
participant "Development Compose" as EC
participant "PostgreSQL / Redis\nloopback listeners" as ED
participant "API container\nservice DNS" as EA
participant "Host tools\nlocalhost defaults" as EH

Developer -> ER : start local stack
ER -> EC : docker compose up -d
EC -> ED : publish 127.0.0.1:5432 / 127.0.0.1:6379
EC -> EA : attach db and redis on internal network
Developer -> EH : alembic / seeds / host uvicorn
EH -> ED : connect through localhost
@enduml

@startuml
title Sentry event capture: exception/request to transport

participant "FastAPI / Starlette" as WEB
participant "_sentry_init_options" as POLICY
participant "Sentry SDK\nevent construction" as SDK
participant "_before_send_filter" as FILTER
participant "Sentry transport" as TRANSPORT

POLICY -> SDK : init integrations, sampling, hooks (H2)
WEB -> SDK : exception / transaction + request context (H1)
SDK -> SDK : build stack frames; implicit local capture (H3)
SDK -> SDK : derive request metadata; implicit body capture (H4)
SDK -> FILTER : constructed event (H5)
FILTER -> FILTER : remove env/cookies/query; redact known keys
FILTER -> TRANSPORT : filtered envelope (H6)

note over POLICY,SDK
Required capture boundary:
include_local_variables = false
max_request_body_size = never
end note

note over FILTER
Retained as defense in depth for
headers, query strings, extras and
integration-supplied event data.
end note
@enduml
